{"number":93,"nameArabic":"الضحى","nameTransliterated":"Ad-Duhaa","nameTranslated":"The Morning Hours","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":11,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"93:1","textAr":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","transliteration":"Waaldduha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By the morning brightness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے روز روشن کی"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"93:2","textAr":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","transliteration":"Waallayli itha saja","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور رات کی جبکہ وہ سکون کے ساتھ طاری ہو جائے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"93:3","textAr":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","transliteration":"Ma waddaAAaka rabbuka wama qala","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(اے نبیؐ) تمہارے رب نے تم کو ہرگز نہیں چھوڑا اور نہ وہ ناراض ہوا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"93:4","textAr":"وَلَلۡأٓخِرَةُ خَيۡرٞ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Walalakhiratu khayrun laka mina aloola","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور یقیناً تمہارے لیے بعد کا دور پہلے دور سے بہتر ہے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"93:5","textAr":"وَلَسَوۡفَ يُعۡطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرۡضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yuAAteeka rabbuka fatarda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور عنقریب تمہارا رب تم کو اتنا دے گا کہ تم خوش ہو جاؤ گے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"93:6","textAr":"أَلَمۡ يَجِدۡكَ يَتِيمٗا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yajidka yateeman faawa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا اس نے تم کو یتیم نہیں پایا اور پھر ٹھکانا فراہم کیا؟"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"93:7","textAr":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلّٗا فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka dallan fahada","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And He found you lost and guided [you]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہیں ناواقف راہ پایا اور پھر ہدایت بخشی"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"93:8","textAr":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلٗا فَأَغۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka AAailan faaghna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہیں نادار پایا اور پھر مالدار کر دیا"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"93:9","textAr":"فَأَمَّا ٱلۡيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقۡهَرۡ","transliteration":"Faamma alyateema fala taqhar","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لہٰذا یتیم پر سختی نہ کرو"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"93:10","textAr":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنۡهَرۡ","transliteration":"Waamma alssaila fala tanhar","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور سائل کو نہ جھڑکو"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"93:11","textAr":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعۡمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثۡ","transliteration":"Waamma biniAAmati rabbika fahaddith","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اپنے رب کی نعمت کا اظہار کرو"}]}]}